        description
        release: When the order is released into the model. An ISO timestamp instead of a number needs a calendar.
        due: Absolute due time, not a lead time; null = no due date. May be an ISO timestamp.
        time_unit: Unit `release` and `due` are in (a dated value ignores it).
        quantity: Entities this order releases.
        entity_type: Overrides the CREATE block's own e_type.
        sequence: Name of a declared routing the entities follow.
        priority: Carried as entity.priority.
        source: CREATE block that releases it; omit for the first CREATE in "Orders" mode.
