        step: Spacing of a regular series; exclusive with "times".
        time_unit: Unit the sample times are expressed in.
        interpolation: step: piecewise constant (exact for a flow rate). linear: interpolate between samples.
        beyond: Past the last sample: hold the last value, repeat the series with its period, or refuse.
