        motion: "gantry" travels directly between two nodes' coordinates (`speed_x`/`speed_y`/`hoist_time`), ignoring the path network and segment capacity; cannot be kind "worker".
        speed_x: Gantry only: speed along x, distance per model time unit.
        speed_y: Gantry only: speed along y, distance per model time unit.
        hoist_time: Gantry only: fixed time added to every hop (raising and lowering the load), in `time_unit`.
        units: Named units, replacing `count` when given.
        loads: Entities one vehicle may carry on a tour: up to loads - 1 waiting TRANSPORTs ride with the one granted the vehicle. 1 on a worker fleet.
        arm: Name of a `motion_profiles` record: the fleet is a mobile cobot, which loads and unloads a STATION that declares `tending` with its arm. Empty or absent: an ordinary fleet. Needs kind "vehicle", motion "network" and loads 1.
        exchange: Arm fleets only: a second holding place, so a cobot arriving loaded at a machine that holds a finished part picks it, places its own and carries the finished one on.
